        osdi:TT_N16_ManY ,
        osdi:TT_N16_ManY_Risk ,
        osdi:TT_Population ,
        osdi:TT_PopulationAge ,
        osdi:TT_PopulationBaseUtility ,
        osdi:TT_PopulationSex ,
        osdi:TT_TreatAnnualCost ;
    osdi:hasDescription "N16. Interventions whose target is a manifestation that depends on a development (ManY, sub-progression of DevA). A patient that presents ManY also presents DevA, but a manifestation may depend on several developments, so this is not supported yet in decision trees and the generation of the tree must fail." .


